\"—so the core is: the image appears on a cinema big screen. I can add minimal cinema context: dark hall, screen, and perhaps subtle ambient light. But the rules say don't invent elaborate themes. Keep it simple: a cinema big screen displaying the image.\n\nSince it's a video generation prompt, I need action/progressive verbs. The image on the screen could be a still frame of a film being projected. Perhaps describe: the big screen displays the vintage street scene as a projected film frame, with the projector beam visible, the cinema hall dark, etc. But careful not to over-invent. The user asked to put the image on"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 778, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [492.11846923828125, 439.6435241699219], "pos": [515.9617919921875, 3186.002685546875], "id": 501, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [733], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [999, "fixed", 50, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 737, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 738, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "正面条件"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 739, "label": "负面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "负面条件"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 734, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "随机种"}, {"widget": 